    "result_text": "Done. The full build passes (BUILD SUCCESS, 0 failures/errors).\n\nI implemented the `contactPreference` derived field:\n\n1. **`openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a read-only `contactPreference` string property to the `Owner` schema (documenting `EMAIL` when an email is present, otherwise `PHONE`). This drives the generated `OwnerDto`.\n\n2. **`OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a `@Mapping` for `contactPreference` and a `contactPreference(owner)` default method returning `\"EMAIL\"` when `owner.getEmail()` is non-blank, otherwise `\"PHONE\"`, consistent with how the other derived fields (locality, membershipLevel, etc.) are computed.\n\nBoth new acceptance tests (`corePhoneWhenNoEmail`, `functionalityEmailWhenPresent`) and the rest of the suite are green.",
